# Legacy WordPress paths that still get linked from outside.
#
# The old frecciagroup.com site published its legal pages at /privacy-policy/
# and /terms-of-use/. Both were dead ends until 2026-09-08: /privacy-policy/
# was mapped to the homepage on the frecciagroup.com redirect site, and
# /terms-of-use/ had no rule at all, so it fell through the catch-all to
# frecciaconstruction.com/terms-of-use/ and 404'd here.
#
# These rules are the second half of that fix. The redirect site handles
# traffic still arriving on frecciagroup.com; these handle anything that
# reaches frecciaconstruction.com directly, whether from an old inbound link
# on the new domain or forwarded by the catch-all.
/privacy-policy/  /privacy  301!
/privacy-policy   /privacy  301!
/terms-of-use/    /terms    301!
/terms-of-use     /terms    301!
